# Supply Chain Analytics & Automation Project

## Overview

This project simulates a real-world end-to-end supply chain analytics workflow using:

- Python
- PostgreSQL
- pandas
- SQL
- CSV automation

The project includes:
- data cleaning pipelines,
- KPI reporting,
- operations automation,
- inventory alerts,
- freight auditing,
- reconciliation automation,
- and automated reporting workflows.

The goal is to replicate realistic analyst and supply chain automation processes commonly used in e-commerce and operations environments.

